    "message": "Factorials are able to become very large very quickly. Therefore, as of version 3.1.0, the BigInteger type is used to perform calculations when factorials are involved. It is not recommended to use versions before 3.1.0, as they will either throw errors or produce incorrect results for calculations with trials above 12.",
